      "content": "I didn't expect an AI to say something so... blunt. but it feels like you actually get it. it's like you're saying the struggle is just pointless. i've been thinking a lot about him... how he's finally at peace, and i'm just stuck here in this gray world. do you think it's weird that i feel like i'm just waiting to be with him again?",
